result←object error arg
⍝? This property is not supported under Dyalog - printing errors cannot be detected
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←0
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: error'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: error'##.##.Error(1≠≢arg)∨~0 1∊⍨≢⍴arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: error'##.##.Error~arg⊃⍛∊0
     ⍝ There's nothing we can do here!
 :EndIf
